WEBVTT

00:04.540 --> 00:10.170
ずっと信じている

00:04.540 --> 00:10.170
zutto shinjite iru

00:04.540 --> 00:10.170
I have always believed

00:10.300 --> 00:14.680
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.300 --> 00:14.680
owaranai yume wo nigiri shimete

00:10.300 --> 00:14.680
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.680 --> 00:17.970
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.690 --> 00:31.610
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.690 --> 00:31.610
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.690 --> 00:31.610
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.960 --> 00:34.670
空回りするけど

00:31.960 --> 00:34.670
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.960 --> 00:34.670
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:35.130 --> 00:38.340
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:35.130 --> 00:38.340
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:35.130 --> 00:38.340
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:38.470 --> 00:42.060
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:38.470 --> 00:42.060
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:38.470 --> 00:42.060
You should be yourself.

00:42.180 --> 00:47.900
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:42.180 --> 00:47.900
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:42.180 --> 00:47.900
But you know, a messed up scenario

00:49.560 --> 00:55.070
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:49.560 --> 00:55.070
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:49.560 --> 00:55.070
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:55.070 --> 00:56.570
TRUST MY WAY

00:56.610 --> 01:02.030
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:56.610 --> 01:02.030
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:56.610 --> 01:02.030
The wind, it caresses my cheek.

01:02.290 --> 01:05.710
風と-緒に心地好く

01:02.290 --> 01:05.710
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:02.290 --> 01:05.710
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.710 --> 01:10.590
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.710 --> 01:10.590
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.710 --> 01:10.590
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.710 --> 01:16.220
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.710 --> 01:16.220
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.710 --> 01:16.220
these feelings won't ever change.

01:16.470 --> 01:20.800
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:16.470 --> 01:20.800
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:16.470 --> 01:20.800
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.800 --> 01:24.430
TRUST ME MY WAY

01:53.070 --> 01:54.580
This really isn't right!

01:54.950 --> 01:58.840
Yoshitaka-kun, get Izumi-san and Mitsuki-chan back from Seiichirou-kun!

01:59.300 --> 02:02.890
Well... I lost the contest.

02:03.360 --> 02:05.460
What's with that attitude?

02:06.000 --> 02:09.370
If you're hungry, you should eat up.

02:09.520 --> 02:11.160
You always leave tons of leftovers.

02:11.960 --> 02:13.870
No... that's all right.

02:14.490 --> 02:16.700
Ah, this isn't like you at all, Yoshitaka-kun!

02:16.990 --> 02:20.210
What happened to the over-the-top Yoshitaka-kun?

02:20.460 --> 02:21.850
Izumi was one thing...

02:22.230 --> 02:24.730
But I can't believe Mitsuki said she was leaving.

02:24.990 --> 02:28.550
I'm sure they would have left no matter what I tried. It's useless.

02:29.200 --> 02:31.390
Now, no matter what I do...

02:31.580 --> 02:32.940
YOU LOSER!

02:34.500 --> 02:37.710
It's not the same with just you and me, Anna-chan.

02:37.940 --> 02:39.330
That's not true!

02:39.580 --> 02:43.600
Even if it's just the two of us, if we work together...

02:43.920 --> 02:46.050
You and... I?

02:46.390 --> 02:47.140
That's right!

02:47.180 --> 02:48.590
You and I, Yoshitaka-kun!

02:48.770 --> 02:50.550
Who else <i>is</i> there?

02:50.970 --> 02:54.650
You and I are the only ones in this house now, Yoshitaka-kun.

02:55.040 --> 02:58.410
No, that's why you can't ever give up!

02:58.840 --> 03:01.060
Even if there's only two of us, if we work together...

03:02.530 --> 03:04.340
Huh? Alone together?

03:04.880 --> 03:05.950
Alone together?

03:07.590 --> 03:09.120
ALONE TOGETHER?!

03:09.590 --> 03:12.150
Yoshitaka-kun and I are... alone together?

03:12.760 --> 03:15.730
Under a single roof with no one to supervise what...

03:16.560 --> 03:18.410
ALONE TOGETHER?!

03:19.220 --> 03:24.220
The Faraway Boyfriend, Yoshitaka

03:27.190 --> 03:30.620
I can't believe Yoshitaka-kun and I are going to be alone together in this house from now on!

03:31.140 --> 03:34.080
The worst situations tend to cause the worst injuries!

03:35.040 --> 03:35.700
Ah, Anna-chan.

03:37.940 --> 03:38.900
Stay away, please!

03:39.250 --> 03:42.560
Even now, I'm saving myself for Izumi-san!

03:42.940 --> 03:44.740
You're worried about something like that?

03:45.050 --> 03:45.740
It's all right.

03:45.930 --> 03:47.070
I'm not going to do anything.

03:47.470 --> 03:49.480
Since Izumi and Mitsuki-chan left...

03:50.140 --> 03:52.570
For some reason, I don't have any such desire.

03:53.460 --> 03:54.450
Yoshitaka-kun's acting really...

03:54.930 --> 03:55.530
WEIRD!

03:55.880 --> 03:59.380
What about you, Anna-chan? Why are you still here?

04:00.050 --> 04:02.110
I mean, Izumi's gone.

04:02.400 --> 04:03.810
E-Even if you say that,

04:04.190 --> 04:06.310
d-don't I have a contract?

04:06.900 --> 04:09.080
Oh, is that it?

04:09.420 --> 04:12.100
There's no way something like that has any binding power.

04:12.440 --> 04:13.390
Didn't you know that?

04:13.650 --> 04:16.610
You can't just force minors to work.

04:16.780 --> 04:17.550
That's a lie!

04:17.800 --> 04:20.840
You plan on using that to threaten me when the time comes!

04:21.030 --> 04:22.670
That's obvious.

04:23.490 --> 04:25.690
If you want to leave, you can go anytime!

04:26.210 --> 04:29.900
Besides, your cooking was so disgusting I couldn't eat it!

04:30.500 --> 04:31.450
Really?

04:31.660 --> 04:35.100
Yoshitaka-kun, I can leave?

04:35.610 --> 04:37.390
I'm just telling you to do whatever you want!

04:38.150 --> 04:39.500
If you're going, hurry up and go!

04:40.210 --> 04:44.080
Besides, at any given moment I might change my mind!

04:45.280 --> 04:45.880
No!

04:46.220 --> 04:47.500
Stay away!

04:51.730 --> 04:52.790
That hurt...

04:53.050 --> 04:55.040
She hit me with all her freaking strength!

04:58.750 --> 05:01.010
So it's just me now, huh?

