05:32.810 --> 05:34.920
Good work, Izumi-sama.

05:35.340 --> 05:37.180
I'm exhausted...

05:37.350 --> 05:40.290
Immediately after this we have a mini-concert,

05:40.440 --> 05:42.330
so before that you need to practice your choreography.

05:42.470 --> 05:43.900
Th-There's more?!

05:47.030 --> 05:50.040
Izumi-san, isn't your schedule a little too hectic?

05:50.610 --> 05:52.710
Ah... please don't move, Master.

05:53.100 --> 05:58.090
Well, I think it's perfect for Onee-chan to be as busy as she is right now.

06:00.480 --> 06:01.580
You look well!

06:01.830 --> 06:02.640
Onee-chan!

06:02.940 --> 06:03.830
Mom!

06:03.990 --> 06:04.710
Karin!

06:06.760 --> 06:07.570
Karin!

06:08.800 --> 06:10.010
You're incredible, Onee-chan!

06:10.250 --> 06:11.940
You kept your promise, didn't you?

06:12.080 --> 06:13.260
Of course I did!

06:13.640 --> 06:15.580
Your sister did her best!

06:15.670 --> 06:18.970
My, Izumi, Mitsuki must have coordinated that outfit.

06:19.150 --> 06:20.470
It's cute!

06:21.430 --> 06:23.370
Yeah... that's true. But how did you know?

06:23.570 --> 06:24.730
I just did!

06:25.270 --> 06:27.380
After all, I was the one who trained her.

06:27.770 --> 06:28.650
Right?

06:30.300 --> 06:30.960
See?

06:33.030 --> 06:34.640
I made something, too!

06:34.900 --> 06:37.300
Wouldn't a mother-daughter idol be so novel?

06:37.500 --> 06:39.510
Novel? That would be embarrassing!

06:41.120 --> 06:42.430
I'm joking, I'm joking.

06:42.900 --> 06:45.030
You're as energetic as always, Izumi.

06:45.240 --> 06:46.730
Not really...

06:47.070 --> 06:50.470
I'm forced to work from morning 'till night... I'm exhausted.

06:50.550 --> 06:50.930
Really?

06:51.220 --> 06:52.020
That's good.

06:52.160 --> 06:53.000
That's <i>good</i>?!

07:00.600 --> 07:01.660
I'll introduce you!

07:02.020 --> 07:05.190
This is our new master.

07:05.270 --> 07:06.810
N-Nice to meet you.

07:07.060 --> 07:08.560
A new pervert?

07:08.780 --> 07:10.440
Oh, a joke!

07:11.240 --> 07:11.860
An Onii-chan?

07:12.070 --> 07:12.700
Onee-chan?

07:13.450 --> 07:14.270
Which is it?

07:14.530 --> 07:15.560
Onii-chan.

07:15.890 --> 07:18.070
I-I'm going to go put on something different.

07:18.310 --> 07:21.080
Pochi is nearby, so let's go play there!

07:21.390 --> 07:22.020
All right!

07:22.190 --> 07:23.800
Karin, I'm sorry.

07:24.070 --> 07:27.080
I still have to keep working.

07:27.320 --> 07:30.510
We can't live together just yet, Karin.

07:31.250 --> 07:31.950
That's okay!

07:32.170 --> 07:35.900
I can see you anytime I want, so I'm just fine.

07:38.840 --> 07:42.330
Still... It's a little disappointing about Yoshitaka-kun.

07:42.510 --> 07:44.170
Don't say stuff like that!

07:44.330 --> 07:46.650
We finally cut ties, and everything is perfectly fair!

07:46.840 --> 07:47.440
I wonder...

07:47.900 --> 07:49.270
You two were really suited for marriage, you know!

07:49.560 --> 07:50.880
Don't tease me.

07:51.080 --> 07:54.740
If that's all you came here to tell me, then hurry up, take dad, and go home!

07:55.180 --> 07:57.010
After all, he's around here somewhere, isn't he?

07:57.960 --> 07:58.950
Hey, don't let him get away!

07:59.400 --> 08:00.410
L-Let go of me!

08:00.620 --> 08:02.240
I'm Izumi's father!

08:02.530 --> 08:04.060
We're related by blood!

08:04.200 --> 08:05.010
Stay still!

08:05.340 --> 08:07.520
Yeah, as if any father would explain himself like that!

08:07.770 --> 08:08.610
<i>I</i> WOULD!

08:08.790 --> 08:09.880
DAMN IT!

08:09.880 --> 08:11.480
IZUMI!

08:10.270 --> 08:11.700
Hold it right there!

08:15.780 --> 08:17.570
Pochi, Karin's here!

08:18.450 --> 08:19.050
Pochi!

08:21.040 --> 08:23.700
Pochi, work hard at your job today, all right?

08:25.370 --> 08:26.660
What's wrong, Pochi?

08:27.000 --> 08:28.550
Pochi isn't happy.

08:32.020 --> 08:36.490
It is kind of hard, true, but I feel like I want to give it my all right now.

08:36.900 --> 08:41.150
Just being able to leave that perverted mansion was a huge weight off my shoulders.

08:41.510 --> 08:42.250
I see.

08:42.410 --> 08:45.290
You seemed a little unhappy to me Izumi,

08:45.910 --> 08:48.180
but hopefully it was just my imagination.

08:48.680 --> 08:49.710
Mom...

08:50.940 --> 08:55.180
Really, though... if you feel so inclined, go back to Yoshitaka-kun's place right away!

08:56.130 --> 08:58.390
Stop saying stuff like that!

08:58.470 --> 09:00.080
Hurry up and go home already!

09:00.160 --> 09:01.780
Come on, Izumi!

09:28.430 --> 09:29.580
What <i>is</i> this thing?

09:29.750 --> 09:30.380
A stray?

09:30.540 --> 09:31.730
How did it get in?

09:32.080 --> 09:32.780
It reeks of puppies!

09:33.090 --> 09:35.180
No... Wait. Let go!

09:36.330 --> 09:38.830
Where are you touching me, you perverted dog!

09:42.970 --> 09:44.400
What happened, Onee-chan?

09:45.600 --> 09:46.770
Anna-chan?

09:50.270 --> 09:51.360
Izumi-san...

09:51.480 --> 09:53.360
Wh-What in the world happened to you?

09:53.690 --> 09:54.590
Anna-chan?

09:54.680 --> 09:56.420
IZUMI-SAAAAN!!

09:56.790 --> 09:58.320
A-Anna-chan!

09:57.650 --> 09:59.860
Izumi-saaaan!

09:58.530 --> 09:59.860
S-Stop it!

09:59.980 --> 10:00.910
Don't leave me!

10:00.910 --> 10:02.490
Stop it!

10:07.080 --> 10:08.960
I-I'm sorry. I-I just...

10:12.510 --> 10:17.000
And so I lost my head and ran away from Yoshitaka-kun's house.

10:17.410 --> 10:19.340
As for what happened next...

10:20.180 --> 10:21.560
I don't remember any of it.

10:23.100 --> 10:23.620
But...

10:24.350 --> 10:27.720
When I came to, I found myself in Izumi-san's bosom!

10:28.220 --> 10:31.720
Anna-chan, you've gone through an incredibly trying journey to get here, haven't you?!

10:32.320 --> 10:35.500
You must be happy to be so highly thought of. Right, Izumi?

10:35.670 --> 10:36.610
Hey, Anna-chan...

10:37.110 --> 10:40.100
I think this would be a good opportunity for you to go back to your home.

10:40.400 --> 10:44.540
You never had a reason to run away in the first place.

10:44.740 --> 10:45.510
No way!

10:45.910 --> 10:48.110
Izumi-san, please don't misunderstand me!

10:48.290 --> 10:51.080
If you say you're not going back to that house no matter what I do,

10:51.340 --> 10:53.820
I'll... become a nun for real!

10:54.020 --> 10:54.610
Huh?!

10:55.400 --> 10:56.860
Is that what you want?

10:57.060 --> 10:58.310
I'll shave it all!

10:57.060 --> 11:04.800
A nun in Japanese culture is typically a Buddhist-like monk; Buddhist nuns may also shave their heads.

11:00.250 --> 11:04.800
You finally have a place to go home to.

11:05.140 --> 11:06.100
There's nothing wrong with that.

11:06.920 --> 11:08.290
That's not fair.

11:08.680 --> 11:12.170
Weren't you the first to leave, Izumi-san?

11:13.830 --> 11:15.660
It's unfair that you left first.

11:16.250 --> 11:18.550
It's horrible that you left me there!

11:19.140 --> 11:21.110
There's nothing to cry about, Anna-chan.

11:21.580 --> 11:24.580
If you'd like, why don't you come work at my home?

11:25.430 --> 11:28.840
I'd gladly welcome another cute girl.

11:29.020 --> 11:30.950
Even if I planned on doing that without you asking me?

11:31.400 --> 11:32.090
W-Well...

11:32.440 --> 11:35.400
Izumi-sama, it's almost curtain time.

11:35.500 --> 11:36.420
Please get ready.

11:36.860 --> 11:37.990
A-All right!

11:38.430 --> 11:40.520
But what am I going to do about this outfit?

11:42.530 --> 11:44.660
What the...? It smells like a wet dog!

11:45.040 --> 11:46.800
What's wrong, Izumi-san?

11:48.630 --> 11:50.830
That's when you should use this!

11:51.110 --> 11:52.540
Th-<i>That</i>?!

11:57.620 --> 12:01.100
Just as I thought... Without Pochi, she lacks intensity.

12:01.460 --> 12:02.990
Pochi, do your best!

12:03.150 --> 12:04.830
Pochi, does your stomach hurt?

12:06.070 --> 12:06.840
Hey, Pochi!

12:07.420 --> 12:10.640
Pochi... What in the world is the matter?

12:18.350 --> 12:20.990
What am I doing?

12:22.580 --> 12:24.120
What's wrong with Onee-chan?

12:24.510 --> 12:26.780
It's really bad without Pochi!

12:27.270 --> 12:29.120
Who can I depend on at a time like this...

12:29.730 --> 12:30.510
That's it!

12:31.240 --> 12:32.820
Anna-san, please help!

12:33.020 --> 12:34.310
Do it for Onee-chan!

12:34.720 --> 12:35.840
For Izumi-san?

12:36.650 --> 12:37.400
Yes!

12:37.400 --> 12:38.630
I'll do anything!

12:38.940 --> 12:40.360
Is that true?

12:40.660 --> 12:41.400
Yes.

12:41.650 --> 12:43.650
It seems there is no mistake about it.

12:43.830 --> 12:44.710
Yoshitaka...

12:45.810 --> 12:46.550
I see.

12:47.280 --> 12:49.340
I'll tell Izumi-san and the others.

12:49.840 --> 12:50.960
Don't worry.

12:51.500 --> 12:55.650
Whatever happens to him no longer has anything to do with us.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.300
That's not fair.

13:00.520 --> 13:03.460
Weren't you the first to leave, Izumi-san?

13:04.200 --> 13:08.830
But isn't it natural that I would leave that kind of guy's house?

13:09.870 --> 13:10.470
But...

13:11.320 --> 13:13.840
I-ZU-MI-SAAAAN!

13:16.980 --> 13:18.260
What are you doing, Anna-chan?

13:18.830 --> 13:20.590
Why are you running, Izumi-san?

13:21.570 --> 13:21.980
Hey, w-

13:22.370 --> 13:23.430
Nooo!

13:23.850 --> 13:24.150
Stop it!

13:24.190 --> 13:25.160
Don't

13:25.390 --> 13:27.020
It's for your own sake, Izumi-san!

13:27.140 --> 13:29.290
Let go of me already, Anna-chan!

13:29.430 --> 13:31.210
They'll see it all if I let got!

13:33.830 --> 13:34.700
Stop it!

13:34.950 --> 13:35.580
No!

13:36.250 --> 13:37.370
Anna-chan!

13:39.640 --> 13:41.250
I said STOP!

13:42.250 --> 13:42.770
Pochi...

13:42.890 --> 13:44.730
That's terrible, Izumi-san!

13:44.070 --> 13:44.730
Pochi?

13:44.850 --> 13:46.830
No, wa-wa-wait!

13:47.730 --> 13:50.140
Pochi, let's do out best next time, all right?

13:56.840 --> 13:58.640
What's wrong, Mitsuki-oneechan?

13:59.110 --> 14:00.710
Pochi isn't happy.

14:04.130 --> 14:06.140
Well, we're going home.

14:06.400 --> 14:08.200
Bye-bye, Izumi-oneechan!

14:08.550 --> 14:10.600
Thanks for today, Karin.

14:16.440 --> 14:17.470
I'm tired.

14:18.030 --> 14:21.380
Why am I doing this?

14:21.500 --> 14:23.480
It's a promise, Mitsuki-oneechan.

14:24.190 --> 14:25.710
Take care of Pochi, okay?

14:25.710 --> 14:26.550
Yeah!

14:26.910 --> 14:30.620
I'm sure he'll be cheerful soon. Leave it to me!

14:30.620 --> 14:31.470
Okay!

14:33.270 --> 14:34.060
Ah, Izumi-san.

14:34.390 --> 14:36.550
Today's performance was a huge success!

14:36.730 --> 14:39.310
It was thanks to Mitsuki, not me.

14:39.640 --> 14:41.560
O-Oh, my. What's wrong, Izumi-san?

14:41.770 --> 14:43.340
You seem to be in a bad mood.

14:43.490 --> 14:45.470
I'm always like this.

14:45.640 --> 14:47.370
You must be tired.

14:48.360 --> 14:49.430
I suppose you're right.

14:49.650 --> 14:51.520
That's from being overworked.

14:52.090 --> 14:55.380
At a time like this, there's nothing better than relaxing!

14:55.810 --> 14:56.870
Ah, that sounds nice!

14:57.810 --> 15:01.270
That reminds me... Have you heard anything about Yoshitaka-kun?

15:01.710 --> 15:02.650
Ah, I have, I have!

15:02.840 --> 15:06.540
This is the latest news... Yoshitaka's gone bankrupt!

15:07.080 --> 15:08.480
Ah, then what's happening to his mansion?

15:09.050 --> 15:10.150
Ah, it's been put up for sale,

15:10.450 --> 15:13.850
but right now Yoshitaka is miss... ing.

15:15.960 --> 15:16.730
Oh, no!

15:17.000 --> 15:17.550
What?!

15:19.810 --> 15:22.520
Izumi-san, weren't you pretty surprised just now?

15:23.050 --> 15:25.480
O-Of course not. There's no way I would be!

15:25.830 --> 15:27.650
Why would I care about Yoshitaka now...?

15:30.520 --> 15:32.720
Izumi-san, are you thirsty?

15:33.170 --> 15:34.910
I'll go get something.

15:36.660 --> 15:42.270
He was allowed to live it up to the point where he became arrogant and brought about his own bankruptcy.

15:42.880 --> 15:48.080
His eye for splendor and everything else would be his downfall, but he didn't notice it.

15:48.780 --> 15:50.910
And so... he paid the price for it.

15:51.640 --> 15:56.470
Well, it's all because Yoshitaka was someone who had no idea how to really use money.

15:57.500 --> 16:02.410
It just means that, in the end, he couldn't hold on to the inheritance that he waited so long to get.

16:06.910 --> 16:10.170
Izumi-san, don't tell me you're worried about h-

16:10.250 --> 16:11.530
Of course not.

16:12.320 --> 16:14.560
Why... would I be?

16:15.490 --> 16:17.200
Pochi, what's wrong?

16:17.460 --> 16:18.620
Do you feel sick?

16:18.950 --> 16:19.780
Pochi...

16:21.580 --> 16:22.560
Mitsuki-chan?

16:22.970 --> 16:25.690
What are you doing here?

16:34.510 --> 16:37.370
Yoshitaka got exactly what he deserved.

16:37.770 --> 16:40.130
He finally had that wonderful mansion,

16:40.640 --> 16:43.480
And he should've been able to live his life without wanting anything.

16:43.920 --> 16:46.610
He was a pervert who could only do deviant things.

16:46.950 --> 16:51.370
Someone like that wouldn't have anybody worry about him.

16:51.960 --> 16:55.410
That's the same as being all alone from the start.

16:58.010 --> 16:58.700
Pochi!

16:58.820 --> 17:00.460
Let go of Mitsuki-chan!

17:01.120 --> 17:01.810
What's wrong?

17:03.510 --> 17:04.350
Onee-chan!

17:04.990 --> 17:06.740
Izumi-san, Pochi is...

17:06.950 --> 17:07.710
Mitsuki!

17:11.490 --> 17:12.520
What are you doing, Pochi?

17:12.700 --> 17:15.660
I can't believe you would hurt Mitsuki!

17:15.830 --> 17:16.380
Hey!

17:16.720 --> 17:17.890
I said let her go!

17:17.970 --> 17:18.550
Pochi!

17:18.710 --> 17:21.580
Anna-san, I'm all right!

17:22.340 --> 17:25.380
Pochi, where are you taking us?

17:26.300 --> 17:29.050
This nature preserve... it can't be!

17:30.820 --> 17:35.780
Under Construction

17:30.820 --> 17:35.780
Sugita Group

17:41.960 --> 17:42.660
Pochi...

17:43.180 --> 17:44.990
You wanted to come back here?

17:51.470 --> 17:52.170
Pochi!

17:52.590 --> 17:53.090
Wait!

17:54.100 --> 17:55.040
Mitsuki!

18:09.270 --> 18:10.740
Wh-What was that?

18:11.850 --> 18:13.790
Rather, what is with you people?

18:21.820 --> 18:25.090
Oh, how unusual to find a hippopotamus in a place like this!

18:25.310 --> 18:26.570
He's not a hippopotamus.

18:26.780 --> 18:28.070
Pochi is an alligator!

18:28.470 --> 18:30.200
What's that?

18:30.470 --> 18:31.930
Who's she?

18:32.050 --> 18:36.500
She's Sugita Takami, the only daughter of the Sugita family.

18:39.000 --> 18:43.160
Ah, and who could this be but Nakabayashi Poor Child-kun?

18:43.360 --> 18:44.570
IT'S NAKABAYASHI SEIICHIROU!

18:45.240 --> 18:48.340
The household Yoshitaka and I belong to and the Sugita family are rivals.

18:48.890 --> 18:51.240
There's been really bad blood between us for a long time.

18:51.700 --> 18:53.560
But why is she here?

18:53.910 --> 18:56.840
This will soon be mine.

18:57.910 --> 19:00.640
So, who might you be?

19:01.500 --> 19:03.270
I'm Sawatari Izumi.

19:04.930 --> 19:09.010
We were working here as maids until the other day.

19:09.210 --> 19:10.910
Maids, you say?

19:12.870 --> 19:14.230
Is that so?

19:14.430 --> 19:16.180
Then I've spoken improperly.

19:16.430 --> 19:18.780
No, maybe I've been improperly spoken to.

19:19.220 --> 19:22.430
It's been a long time since I've spoken with people of the lower class.

19:23.310 --> 19:26.770
This plot of land is currently on the market for next to nothing.

19:27.330 --> 19:31.070
Each and every one of the obstructive buildings will be destroyed,

19:31.220 --> 19:35.950
and this will be turned into a wonderful rest house for my exclusive use!

19:36.630 --> 19:41.520
Yoshitaka... he agreed to the sale of this mansion?!

19:41.920 --> 19:45.270
If he loses this, he won't have a place for himself!

19:45.750 --> 19:50.150
Does someone who's been forced out by bankruptcy really have a say?

19:52.050 --> 19:58.580
Moreover, I've never heard of something so foolish as to be weakened by his own maids as he was!

19:59.000 --> 20:03.320
Yoshitaka... Yoshitaka wouldn't give up and roll over!

20:03.630 --> 20:07.760
Not someone like him, who is tenacious and quick to hold a grudge over even the slightest of things!

20:08.300 --> 20:10.350
It's just what he deserves, isn't it?

20:10.600 --> 20:13.850
Besides, you speak as if this doesn't concern you,

20:14.210 --> 20:17.570
but is it not <i>you</i> who is concerned about this mansion?

20:18.750 --> 20:19.630
Me?

20:22.660 --> 20:23.450
Incidentally...

20:23.780 --> 20:25.480
What about your diminutive friend over there?

20:25.750 --> 20:27.220
Who's diminutive?!

20:27.430 --> 20:29.710
That girl is my little sister, Mitsuki!

20:31.200 --> 20:32.120
<i>Your little sister, huh?</i>

20:32.910 --> 20:34.140
<i>So that's how it is.</i>

20:36.000 --> 20:36.920
Indeed.

20:37.230 --> 20:39.140
Then why don't <i>we</i> do this?

20:39.630 --> 20:43.380
How do you feel about having a single contest with me?

20:43.490 --> 20:44.360
A contest?

20:46.030 --> 20:50.590
If you defeat me, I will turn over this entire mansion to you!

20:50.730 --> 20:51.670
That's ridiculous!

20:52.430 --> 20:53.710
Are you joking?!

20:54.020 --> 20:54.900
I'm serious.

20:55.540 --> 20:57.900
And you... Are you making fun of me?

20:57.990 --> 21:01.340
But there's nothing good in it for you!

21:01.510 --> 21:03.200
Be careful, Izumi-san!

21:04.950 --> 21:06.230
It is just as you say.

21:06.630 --> 21:09.900
If I win and you lose, then at that time...

21:12.250 --> 21:13.840
I will take that girl!

21:15.720 --> 21:17.600
Wh-What are you talking about?!

21:17.720 --> 21:19.510
There's no<i> way</i> I would accept that contest!

21:20.900 --> 21:23.940
Do not say that. Think it over thoroughly.

21:24.750 --> 21:27.740
I will listen to your answer here in one week's time.

21:29.960 --> 21:31.320
I've changed my mind!

21:31.760 --> 21:32.970
All workers, fall in!

21:33.190 --> 21:34.980
We will suspend construction for the time being!

21:35.390 --> 21:37.340
Giddyup, Kashiharagou!

21:41.580 --> 21:43.670
Well then, please excuse me.

21:46.920 --> 21:49.260
Izumi-san, are you going to accept the contest?

21:49.750 --> 21:50.640
No way...

21:51.260 --> 21:52.750
Why am I...

21:53.020 --> 21:56.210
You can't go up against someone like that, Izumi-san.

21:56.730 --> 21:57.580
Izumi-san?

21:59.000 --> 21:59.970
Yoshitaka...

22:01.400 --> 22:04.320
Where are you? What are you doing at a time like this?

22:05.290 --> 22:06.360
YOSHITAKA!

22:28.020 --> 22:31.450
見た目の甘さほどは

22:28.020 --> 22:31.450
mitame no amasa hodo ha

22:28.020 --> 22:31.450
They only appear sweet for a moment

22:31.460 --> 22:35.200
儚いとか 弱くもないから

22:31.460 --> 22:35.200
hakanai to ka yowaku mo nai kara

22:31.460 --> 22:35.200
and they're not weak either.

22:35.230 --> 22:40.170
女の子は結構頑丈よ

22:35.230 --> 22:40.170
onnanoko ha kekkou ganjou yo

22:35.230 --> 22:40.170
Girls are pretty stable.

22:42.250 --> 22:45.460
意地っ張り空回りを

22:42.250 --> 22:45.460
ijippari karamawari wo

22:42.250 --> 22:45.460
Because they're stubborn,

22:45.540 --> 22:49.320
楽しめちゃう余裕も大事ネ!

22:45.540 --> 22:49.320
tanoshimechau yoyuu mo daiji ne!

22:45.540 --> 22:49.320
they can enjoy getting nothing done; free time is precious, too.

22:49.330 --> 22:54.050
笑顔にはたっぷりのスパイスが

22:49.330 --> 22:54.050
egao ni ha tappuri no SUPAISU ga

22:49.330 --> 22:54.050
Is there a good deal of spice in that smile?

22:54.750 --> 22:56.380
どうかナ?

22:54.750 --> 22:56.380
dou ka na?

22:54.750 --> 22:56.380
I wonder...

22:56.660 --> 23:02.780
常識など壊す刺激的なヒミツ

22:56.660 --> 23:02.780
joushiki nado kowasu shigekitekina himitsu

22:56.660 --> 23:02.780
The stimulating secret that smashes common sense,

23:02.910 --> 23:10.400
スカートでそっと巧く隠してる

23:02.910 --> 23:10.400
SUKATTO de sotto umaku kakushiteru

23:02.910 --> 23:10.400
is well-concealed within their skirts.

23:10.500 --> 23:17.280
愛情のカタマリでこの気持ち出来てる

23:10.500 --> 23:17.280
aijou no katamari de kono kimochi dekiteru

23:10.500 --> 23:17.280
I have a feeling this can be a mass of love.

23:17.540 --> 23:24.260
キュんとなるシュンカンを夢みていたいから

23:17.540 --> 23:24.260
KYUN to naru shunkan wo yume miteitai kara

23:17.540 --> 23:24.260
Because I want to have dreams of this moment, that will not matter.

23:24.580 --> 23:31.590
愛情のカタマリでオトメは進化する

23:24.580 --> 23:31.590
aijou no katamari de otome ha shinka suru

23:24.580 --> 23:31.590
The maidens grow in a mass of love,

23:31.650 --> 23:38.700
トキメキもカガヤキも抱きしめているから

23:31.650 --> 23:38.700
TOKIMEKI mo kagayaki mo dakishimeteiru kara

23:31.650 --> 23:38.700
because they are embracing their glowing excitement.

23:45.470 --> 23:48.270
Izumi, I've really been a terrible person up until now, haven't I?

23:48.560 --> 23:49.930
What's with you, Yoshitaka?

23:50.080 --> 23:51.800
Why are you saying things like that?

23:51.930 --> 23:54.990
What do you plan to do from now on if you part with that mansion?

23:55.070 --> 23:56.470
Don't worry about me.

23:56.890 --> 23:59.140
You're free now, so live as you like.

23:59.250 --> 24:00.980
I was free from the start!

24:01.190 --> 24:03.990
I've never been what you really wanted at the bottom of your heart!

24:04.080 --> 24:04.670
I see.

24:05.220 --> 24:06.910
But let me say one thing at the end.

24:07.120 --> 24:09.160
I'm sorry for doing all of those terrible things.

24:08.720 --> 24:13.720
He is My Master!!

24:09.410 --> 24:12.340
What happened to you, Yoshitaka, for you to say all those things?
